#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-repurposed.rst:83
#: 9aab765367314e83adb6da90a2e46698
msgid "FrSky telemetry data consists of 16 or 32bit unsigned integers recognized by OpenTX. Standard FrSky telemetry does not include autopilot messages natively. Therefore, less important telemetry data messages (temperature, variometer…) have been repurposed to carry more useful information such as flight mode."
msgstr ""

